# The on-screen keyboard's Ctrl (one-shot) then a letter reaches the field as Ctrl+A / C / X / V, with the launcher's
# clipboard (docs/dev/clipboard.md): select all, copy, delete the selection with the keyboard's Backspace, paste, cut. The
# keyboard itself is not changed and is neither summoned nor sent away by any of it (expect_osk). APPLAUNCH_OSK=force
# stands for "no physical keyboard". Review only.
title text field: on-screen keyboard Ctrl+A, C, X, V
review
sizes 800x480 640x480 480x320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK force
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
fielddemo
wait 300
expect_osk shown
shot osk_start
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey a
expect_selection Name 0 16
shot osk_select_all
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey c
clipboard expect "café €5 and more"
tapkey BACKSPACE
expect_field Name ""
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey v
expect_field Name "café €5 and more"
expect_caret Name 16
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey a
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey x
expect_field Name ""
clipboard expect "café €5 and more"
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey v
expect_field Name "café €5 and more"
expect_osk shown
shot osk_pasted
